# Binary solvent mixtures for COSMO-RS solubility screening.
# Format (whitespace-separated):
#   <label>  <solvent1>  <solvent2>  <x1>  <x2>
# - label is used as filename suffix (no spaces, slashes, or weird chars)
# - solvent1, solvent2 are COSMObase basenames (same as in solvents-pure.list)
# - x1, x2 are mole fractions of solvent1 and solvent2; must sum to 1.0
# Comment lines start with '#'.

# label                          solvent1               solvent2               x1     x2
water-ethanol-70-30              h2o                    ethanol                0.70   0.30
water-ethanol-50-50              h2o                    ethanol                0.50   0.50
water-ethanol-30-70              h2o                    ethanol                0.30   0.70
water-methanol-50-50             h2o                    methanol               0.50   0.50
water-acetonitrile-70-30         h2o                    acetonitrile           0.70   0.30
water-acetonitrile-50-50         h2o                    acetonitrile           0.50   0.50
water-dmso-90-10                 h2o                    dimethylsulfoxide      0.90   0.10
water-dmso-70-30                 h2o                    dimethylsulfoxide      0.70   0.30
hexane-etac-50-50                hexane                 ethylacetate           0.50   0.50
methanol-chloroform-50-50        methanol               chcl3                  0.50   0.50
